%abc-2.1
% CONTROL — the second pass over abcjs's directive switch. The first measured every absent
% directive on ONE plain tune; these SEVEN move its output only in a shape that can reach
% them — a subtitle, a composer, a `W:`, four bars, a beam, a grace group. `%%topspace` is
% the eighth and is PRINT-only, so no screen golden can gate it.
%
% Goldens generated by running abcjs 6.7.0 at {staffwidth: 670}.
X:1
T:subtitlespace
T:the subtitle
%%subtitlespace 40
L:1/4
M:4/4
K:C
CDEF|

X:2
T:composerspace
C:the composer
%%composerspace 40
L:1/4
M:4/4
K:C
CDEF|

X:3
T:wordsspace
%%wordsspace 40
L:1/4
M:4/4
K:C
CDEF|
W:the words below

X:4
T:barsperstaff
%%barsperstaff 2
L:1/4
M:4/4
K:C
CDEF|GABc|CDEF|GABc|

X:5
T:flatbeams
%%flatbeams 1
L:1/8
M:4/4
K:C
CDEF GABc|

X:6
T:graceslurs
%%graceslurs 0
L:1/4
M:4/4
K:C
{ab}c d e f|
